rl": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/4/"}, "version_group": {"name": "legends-za", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/30/"}}, {"flavor_text": "Le lanceur baisse la tête pendant un court instant pour augmenter sa Défense, puis percute sa cible. L’attaque prend un certain temps à se déclencher.", "language": {"name": "fr", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"}, "version_group": {"name": "legends-za", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/30/"}}, {"flavor_text": "Der Anwender zieht den Kopf ein, um seine Verteidigung für kurze Zeit zu erhöhen, und prescht dann vor, um anzugreifen. Der Angriff geschieht mit Verzögerung.", "language": {"name": "de", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/6/"}, "version_group": {"name": "legends-za", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/30/"}}, {"flavor_text": "El usuario retrae la cabeza y aumenta su Defensa durante un breve período de tiempo, tras lo cual embiste al objetivo. El movimiento requiere tiempo para ejecutarse.", "language": {"name": "es", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"}, "version_group": {"name": "legends-za", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/30/"}}, {"flavor_text": "Il Pokémon ritira la testa aumentando la Difesa per un po’ di tempo, per poi attaccare il bersaglio lanciandoglisi contro. L’attacco richiede tempo.", "language": {"name": "it", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/8/"}, "version_group": {"name": "legends-za", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/30/"}}, {"flavor_text": "The user boosts its Defense stat for a short time by tucking its head in, then attacks by ramming into targets. This move takes some time to carry out.", "language": {"name": "en", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"}, "version_group": {"name": "legends-za", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/30/"}}, {"flavor_text": "頭をひっこめて少しのあいだ防御を上げた後つっこんで攻撃する。攻撃するまで時間がかかる。", "language": {"name": "ja", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/l